#: dtime.cpp:71
#, fuzzy
msgid "Here you can change the system date's day of the month, month and year."
msgstr "Hier jy kan verander die stelsel datum se dag van die maand."

#: dtime.cpp:124
msgid ""
"Here you can change the system time. Click into the hours, minutes or "
"seconds field to change the relevant value, either using the up and down "
"buttons to the right or by entering a new value."
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan verander die stelsel tyd. Kliek binnein die ure, minute of "
"sekondes veld na verander die relevante waarde, òf te gebruik die begin en "
"ondertoe knoppies na die regterkant of deur in te tik 'n nuwe waarde."

#: dtime.cpp:223
msgid "Can not set date."
msgstr "Kan nie stel datum."

#: dtime.cpp:252 main.cpp:89
msgid ""
"<h1>Date & Time</h1> This control module can be used to set the system date "
"and time. As these settings do not only affect you as a user, but rather the "
"whole system, you can only change these settings when you start the Control "
"Center as root. If you don't have the root password, but feel the system "
"time should be corrected, please contact your system administrator."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Datum & Tyd</h1> Hierdie kontrole module kan wees gebruik word na stel "
"die stelsel Datum en Tyd. as hierdie instellings doen nie slegs affekteer jy "
"as 'n gebruiker, maar eerder die volledige stelsel, jy kan slegs verander "
"hierdie instellings wanneer jy begin die kontrole Sentrum as root. As jy "
"moet nie het die root wagwoord, maar gevoel die stelsel Tyd moet wees "
"korrigeer, asseblief kontak jou stelsel administrateur."

